Square Dracula

The Sprig front-end derives from the mods, layout and themes Herdr ships:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app (the 0.1.13 base is pinned in
upstreams.json) and from Kyle Avrett's Square Dracula,
https://github.com/kyle-avrett/herdr-square-dracula.

Herdr's source is licensed under Apache-2.0; a copy is included in LICENSE.
The derived appearance is not carried as a separate layout bundle: the Dracula
palette, square and gapless styling, compact tabs, read-only Changes panel,
menu framing, and sidebar footer spacing live in the app's own mods, layout and
theme, and the JavaScript files carry their change notices.

The Rowan terminal layout `rowan-terminal`, the app's default, and the rowan-*
mods add Tokyo Night terminal
appearance, persistent compact herds, profile-scoped repository folding and
navigation, stable display labels, and an OMP display-only metadata companion.
These local changes were AI-authored for Joseph Rosenbaum on 2026-10-30 and
retain the upstream Apache-2.0 notices.

Some copied SVG glyphs are from Lucide and its Feather-derived icons.
